  "summary_en": "Japan's first AI Basic Plan under the 2025 AI Promotion Act, adopted December 2025. It aims to make Japan the most AI-friendly country through innovation-first policy, trustworthy AI, strengthened AI Safety Institute, international cooperation (Hiroshima Process), and support for physical AI, autonomous driving and robots, with civil liability for AI accidents to be examined.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Three principles and four basic policies: adopt AI, create AI, lead AI governance, collaborate with AI",
   "Strategically promote R&D and demonstration of physical AI, AI robots and advanced autonomous driving",
   "Double AI Safety Institute staffing and strengthen AI evaluation and security functions",
   "Examine the location and scope of civil liability for AI accidents and review existing regulations",
   "Promote Hiroshima AI Process, ISO/IEC standardization and balanced international discussion on military AI"
